; Three UI cues in one take, at 120 BPM (a beat is half a second).
;   0.00  cursor blip, high square
;   0.50  cursor blip again
;   1.00  confirm, a quick major arpeggio
;   1.50  cancel, three low saw ticks
@title UI blips
@tempo 120
@master 15 15

A o6 v31 w square p15,12 q8
  c32 [r32]7
  c32 [r32]7
  o5 c32 e32 g32 >c32 [r32]4
  o2 w saw v24 c16 c16 c16 r8
